### Test SePay Webhook - Success Case
# This mocks a successful bank transfer webhook for Order ARF123
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sepay/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer ${SEPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET}

{
  "gateway": "Sepay",
  "transfer_amount": 650000.00,
  "content": "ARF123",
  "code": "FT123456789",
  "accountNumber": "BIDV123456",
  "id": 987654321
}

### Test SePay Webhook - Failure Case (Insufficient Amount - Missing Shipping Fee)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sepay/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer ${SEPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET}

{
  "gateway": "Sepay",
  "transfer_amount": 600000.00,
  "content": "ARF123",
  "code": "FT123456790",
  "accountNumber": "BIDV123456",
  "id": 987654322
}
